<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hanil Synthetic H1 net loss eases.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hanil Synthetic H1 net loss eases.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>    Shr (won, both losses)    504    vs     4,641</p>
<p>    Net loss		     7.64    vs     69.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		   350.82    vs    218.66</p>
<p>Note - Hanil Synthetic Fiber Co Ltd is South Korea's leading acrylic products manufacturer. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
